#. copy/eyebrow
#: src/js/hieda-index.js:24
msgctxt "tree:copy#/eyebrow"
msgid "HIEDA INDEX / FIVE RECORDS OF ONE THING"
msgstr "HIEDA INDEX / 同じ出来事の五つの記録"

#. copy/title
#: src/js/hieda-index.js:24
msgctxt "tree:copy#/title"
msgid ""
"Every event happens\nat least five times."
msgstr ""
"出来事は、\n最低でも五回起こる。"

#. copy/lead
#: src/js/hieda-index.js:24
msgctxt "tree:copy#/lead"
msgid ""
"Once on site, once in rules, once in news, once in student talk—and once "
"more in the margin Akyuu refuses to erase."
msgstr "現場で一度、規程で一度、新聞で一度、学生の口で一度。そして最後に、阿求が消さない欄外で起こる。"

#. copy/notice
#: src/js/hieda-index.js:24
msgctxt "tree:copy#/notice"
msgid ""
"This machine does not choose one campus truth. It lays mutually "
"contradictory, mutually citing, mutually evasive records on one desk."
msgstr "唯一の真実を選ぶ機械ではありません。矛盾し、引用し合い、互いを知らないふりをする記録を同じ机へ広げます。"

#. copy/events
#: src/js/hieda-index.js:24
msgctxt "tree:copy#/events"
msgid "Read by event"
msgstr "事案から読む"

#. copy/characters
#: src/js/hieda-index.js:24
msgctxt "tree:copy#/characters"
