msgstr "この赤糸の結び方"

#. copy/contradiction
#: src/js/hieda-index.js:24
msgctxt "tree:copy#/contradiction"
msgid "Contradiction retained by Akyuu"
msgstr "阿求が残した矛盾"

#. copy/people
#: src/js/hieda-index.js:24
msgctxt "tree:copy#/people"
msgid "Fingerprints on this leaf"
msgstr "この頁の手印"

#. copy/versionSources
#: src/js/hieda-index.js:24
msgctxt "tree:copy#/versionSources"
msgid "Chronicle versions this event passed through"
msgstr "この出来事を通った大学史版"

#. copy/localTitle
#: src/js/hieda-index.js:24
msgctxt "tree:copy#/localTitle"
msgid "Records you left in the margin"
msgstr "あなたが欄外へ残した記録"

#. copy/localLead
#: src/js/hieda-index.js:24
msgctxt "tree:copy#/localLead"
msgid ""
"Reads only the official campus ledger on this device. Nothing uploads, and "
"nothing you did not do gets invented."
msgstr "この端末の正式キャンパス ledger だけを読みます。送信も、未実施の出来事の追記もしません。"

#. copy/localEmpty
#: src/js/hieda-index.js:24
msgctxt "tree:copy#/localEmpty"
msgid ""
"This leaf does not know your handwriting yet. Borrow, vote, close a case, "
"enrol, or defend work in a source file."
msgstr "この頁はまだあなたの筆跡を知りません。原簿で借用、投票、終結、履修、答弁を行えば見分けます。"

#. copy/localOpen
#: src/js/hieda-index.js:24
msgctxt "tree:copy#/localOpen"
msgid "See the full record in My TU"
msgstr "My TU ですべてを見る"

#. copy/subject
#: src/js/hieda-index.js:24
msgctxt "tree:copy#/subject"
msgid "Record subject"
msgstr "記録主体"

#. copy/caused
#: src/js/hieda-index.js:24
msgctxt "tree:copy#/caused"
msgid "Direct cause"
msgstr "直接前因"

#. copy/openDossier
#: src/js/hieda-index.js:24
msgctxt "tree:copy#/openDossier"
msgid "Open this event"
msgstr "この出来事を開く"

#. copy/relatedDossiers
#: src/js/hieda-index.js:24
msgctxt "tree:copy#/relatedDossiers"
msgid "Files involving this character"
msgstr "この人物が関わる案件"

#. copy/versionDossiers
#: src/js/hieda-index.js:24
msgctxt "tree:copy#/versionDossiers"
msgid "Files moved by this version"
msgstr "この版が動かした案件"

#. copy/characterNote
#: src/js/hieda-index.js:24
msgctxt "tree:copy#/characterNote"
msgid ""
"Characters are not flattened into consistent positions. One name can be "
"teacher, witness, maintainer, and cause of trouble."
msgstr "人物を一貫した立場には整理しません。同じ名が教員、証人、保守担当、厄介事の原因を兼ねます。"

#. copy/versionNote
#: src/js/hieda-index.js:24
msgctxt "tree:copy#/versionNote"
msgid ""
"The first-parent commit is the chronicle source. A feature subject and "
"campus consequence may meet, but may not impersonate each other."
msgstr "主分岐 commit が大学史正本です。機能主旨と校内の結果は出会えても、互いを名乗れません。"

#. copy/gitSource
#: src/js/hieda-index.js:24
msgctxt "tree:copy#/gitSource"
msgid "Open Git source"
msgstr "Git 正本を見る"

#. copy/archiveSource
#: src/js/hieda-index.js:24
msgctxt "tree:copy#/archiveSource"
msgid "Open chronicle leaf"
msgstr "大学史頁を開く"

#. copy/copied
#: src/js/hieda-index.js:24
msgctxt "tree:copy#/copied"
msgid "This leaf's red-thread address is copied."
msgstr "この頁の赤糸住所を写しました。"

#. copy/share
#: src/js/hieda-index.js:24
msgctxt "tree:copy#/share"
msgid "Copy this leaf's address"
msgstr "この頁の住所を写す"

#. copy/noMatch
#: src/js/hieda-index.js:24
msgctxt "tree:copy#/noMatch"
msgid "That phrase is absent from every visible index slip."
msgstr "この語は可視索引札に見つかりません。"

#. copy/allRecords
#: src/js/hieda-index.js:24
msgctxt "tree:copy#/allRecords"
msgid "All linked leaves"
msgstr "全関連紙"

